{"nodes": [{"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_scoping_isolation", "label": "main.[page-slug] Scoping & Isolation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same isolation goal as the FBB spec but keyed to a slug class root (main.packaging-landing) rather than an id. Every property marked !important to prevent theme bleed; one declaration per line; non-colour rules inherited once from the root and never duplicated inside theme overrides."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_theme_architecture", "label": "Dual-Theme Token Architecture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Light is always the default with no attribute; dark is main.page-slug[data-theme=\"dark\"]. A bare [data-theme] selector without the page-slug parent is forbidden because it would escape the isolation boundary and hit the host theme."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_colour_tokens", "label": "Dual-Theme Colour Token Set", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Richer token set than the FBB spec \u2014 adds brand gradients, glass tints, glow and a three-step shadow scale, and re-picks brand blue per theme (#0082c8 light \u2192 #2ea6e6 dark) so the accent stays legible on a navy ground."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_even_px_rule", "label": "Even-Pixel Font Size Rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All font sizes must be even integers in px, including clamp() endpoints; any value resolving odd rounds up to the next even integer. Enforced as a checklist item so pages built at different times stay on one scale."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_section_gradient_alternation", "label": "nth-of-type Section Gradient Alternation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Odd/even sections carry opposite linear-gradient fades so one colour bleeds into the next with no border-top, border-bottom or box-shadow ever placed between sections; transition:background-color .35s ease keeps the theme toggle smooth."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_eyebrow_label", "label": "Gradient Eyebrow Label", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a77.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_card_system", "label": "Card & Lift-Card System", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a77.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shared surface/border/radius/shadow base with a brand-tinted border-color on hover via color-mix, so hover state derives from the brand token instead of a second hard-coded colour."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_button_system", "label": "Gradient Button System", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a77.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Primary uses --brand-grad rather than the flat brand fill of the FBB/brand-guideline button system \u2014 a divergence between the two landing-page lineages."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_animation_system", "label": "Reveal & Keyframe Animation System", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IntersectionObserver .reveal/.in-view with directional variants and a six-step stagger, plus named keyframes (eco-idle-float, eco-flow, eco-float, zig-dots-flow, tele-pulse, poFadeUp). Always wrapped in prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_hero_pattern", "label": "Hero Pattern with Ecosystem Visual", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1.05fr/.95fr two-column hero with a radial brand glow and an SVG ecosystem diagram animated by stroke-dasharray pulse lines; min-height 100vh explicitly not required so content can breathe."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_theme_toggle_button", "label": "Fixed Theme Toggle Button", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a79.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sun/moon swap done purely with scoped display rules under the data-theme attribute rather than JS icon replacement, keeping the toggle stateless in script."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_section_sequence", "label": "Eight-Section Page Sequence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Extends the brand's seven-section rhythm with a final full-width gradient CTA banner + demo request form, and reorders Stats after Challenges."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_css_architecture_checklist", "label": "CSS Architecture Checklist", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a713", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pre-submission gate covering scoping, !important, one-line rules, even-px sizes, token placement, gradient section blends, no inter-section borders, reduced-motion and forced-colors, and no raw colour values outside the token block."}, {"id": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_accessibility", "label": "Dual-Theme Accessibility Rules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a712", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adds a skip-to-content link and a forced-colors:active fallback (border:1px solid ButtonText on interactive controls) on top of the shared focus-visible and reduced-motion rules."}], "edges": [{"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_scoping_isolation", "target": "111_ai_htmls_fbb_design_spec_scoping_isolation", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_theme_architecture", "target": "111_ai_htmls_fbb_design_spec_theme_architecture", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_section_gradient_alternation", "target": "111_ai_htmls_fbb_design_spec_section_blend_gradient", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_section_gradient_alternation", "target": "111_ai_htmls_ithena_brand_guidelines_section_alternation_soft_blend", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_even_px_rule", "target": "111_ai_htmls_ithena_brand_guidelines_type_scale", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_eyebrow_label", "target": "111_ai_htmls_ithena_brand_guidelines_eyebrow_kicker", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a77.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_button_system", "target": "111_ai_htmls_ithena_brand_guidelines_button_system", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a77.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_animation_system", "target": "111_ai_htmls_ithena_brand_guidelines_motion_principles", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_section_sequence", "target": "111_ai_htmls_fbb_design_spec_section_sequence", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_css_architecture_checklist", "target": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_even_px_rule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a713", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_css_architecture_checklist", "target": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_section_gradient_alternation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a713", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_css_architecture_checklist", "target": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_scoping_isolation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a713", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_hero_pattern", "target": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_animation_system", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a79.5, \u00a710.3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_theme_toggle_button", "target": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_theme_architecture", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a79.6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "111_ai_htmls_dual_theme_landing_page_spec_accessibility", "target": "111_ai_htmls_fbb_design_spec_accessibility", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "dual-theme-landing-page-spec.md", "source_location": "\u00a712", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}